        "gcZWVLbedZTXv_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;\"><strong>MenoMate</strong></span> comprehensive formula helps women:</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_0": "<p><strong>Wake up feeling refreshed and energized </strong>(not exhausted before the day begins)</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Zip up pants </strong>that haven't fit comfortably in years</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Feel confident </strong>wearing fitted clothes again</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Experience fewer hot flashes </strong>during important meetings or social events</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_4": "<p><strong>Enjoy stable energy </strong>throughout the day (no more 3 PM crashes)</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_5": "<p><strong>Feel emotionally balanced and in control</strong></p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_6": "<p><strong>Love Your Reflection</strong> - Catch yourself smiling each time you pass a mirror</p>",
        "gg53y8CdYfE_childItem_7": "<p>Look in the mirror and <strong>recognize the vibrant woman looking back</strong></p>",
        "gBDdLKvHGhlOD_text": "<p>I used to dread bedtime because of night sweats. Now, I actually look forward to resting I stay cool and wake up, energized!</p>",
