        "ggp3j1rju7V_text": "<p>OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health</p>",
        "gg1zRYdUeGn_text": "<p>Dr. Ross applies decades of clinical experience to refine MenoMate’s synergy of herbs, adaptogens, and nutrients. She knows firsthand how critical safe, natural relief is for women facing night sweats, bloating, and energy crashes.</p>",
        "ggMuOiZI93L_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
