        "gLMqljgsEnLpa_text": "<p>With 15 years of clinical practice in holistic hormone health, Dr. Claire pinpoints the root causes of menopause symptoms—like hot flashes, mood swings, and stubborn weight gain. She laid the foundation for MenoMate’s powerful formula, ensuring each ingredient specifically targets menopausal discomfort.</p>",
        "gDAPwvGpEuQzS_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
