        "ggnhcgAYMUG_text": "<p>Driven by his wife’s struggle with menopause, Kevin devoted himself to finding premium herbs and cutting-edge solutions. He travels worldwide to secure top-tier ingredients—making MenoMate a labor of love that reflects his commitment to purity and efficacy.</p>",
