        "checksum": "6dc93f2de41679bd7680ca87d371bffc4813f32c7dae00ae3719fd7e405ff0d2_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-9581e136-ad75-4e9d-a5fd-9dd3c24ec4cd.png",
        "gszYGqLzOBmUe_text": "<p>Over <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">682,700+</span> Women Have Transformed Their Menopause Experience with MenoMate</p>",
        "gOYLtzXPaWRMh_text": "<p>Hear how real women are thriving through menopause with MenoMate:</p>",
        "gkzvDKVxbbZMn_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>\"I finally have my body back!\"</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\"At 52, menopause hit me like a freight train. The worst part was watching my waistline expand despite my best efforts. The bloating was constant, and my energy levels plummeted.</p><p>After trying three different menopause supplements with minimal results, I discovered MenoMate. Within just two weeks, I noticed my clothes fitting better, and the afternoon energy crashes disappeared.</p><p>Three months later, I've lost 2.5 inches from my waist, hot flashes are rare events rather than daily occurrences, and I'm sleeping through the night again. My husband says I'm 'back to my old self' – but honestly, I feel even better than before!\"</p>",
        "gvNWNthLsiGRD_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gzoNOfWvxkEJP_text": "Donna s.",
        "ggpTXsDpIcJ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "gdibeONFxMzze_text": "Verified buyer",
        "giPpISqNpXyua_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>\"Perfect for perimenopause\"</strong></span></p><p>\"I'm still in perimenopause, but the symptoms were already making me miserable. Unpredictable periods, mood swings, and a new layer of belly fat that appeared practically overnight.</p><p>MenoMate has been my secret weapon. Within the first month, I noticed my digestion improving and those sugar cravings that used to hit every afternoon have virtually disappeared. My energy is consistent throughout the day, my sleep has improved dramatically, and I've lost 8 pounds without changing anything else in my routine.</p><p>What impresses me most is how balanced I feel emotionally. No more unexplained tearfulness or irritability. I'm recommending this to all my friends approaching this life stage!\"</p>",
        "ggG22Dad8X2_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggOCh3t-eUS_text": "<p>Maria T.</p>",
        "ggVz7hxKNzx_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
