    "gp_section_562338606719435787": {
      "type": "gp-section-562338606719435787",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "dda4372519076131cd043516f1ca83ea1a78323d3b89377474d55d694cea10f1_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggWZOJw61rQ_text": "Experience These Transformations With Daily <span style=\"color:#772B90;\">MenoMate</span>:",
        "ggqXu5sL5mB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-521aa76a-8a33-4210-8e27-be99ece9f52c.png",
        "ggqXu5sL5mB_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-58a03dde-1b0e-4dcf-833a-178638c0dac9.jpg",
        "gghUexIHCOn_childItem_0": "<p><strong>A Flatter, More Comfortable Midsection</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>MenoMate's probiotic blend and anti-inflammatory ingredients work together to reduce bloating and target hormonal belly fat, helping you feel comfortable in your clothes again.</p>",
        "gghUexIHCOn_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Freedom From Hot Flashes</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Black Cohosh and Turmeric work synergistically to cool your internal thermostat, reducing both the frequency and intensity of hot flashes and night sweats.</p>",
        "gghUexIHCOn_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Sustainable Energy Throughout Your Day</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>By supporting healthy metabolism and reducing inflammation, MenoMate helps eliminate the energy crashes and fatigue that many women experience during menopause.</p>",
        "gghUexIHCOn_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Improved Mood and Mental Clarity</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>The gut-brain connection is powerful. By rebalancing your gut microbiome, MenoMate helps support neurotransmitter production and reduce brain fog.</p>",
        "gghUexIHCOn_childItem_4": "<p><strong>Natural Appetite Control</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>By supporting your body&#039;s GLP-1 production, MenoMate helps you feel satisfied with appropriate portions and reduces cravings for sugar and processed foods.</p>",
        "gg8SeftFjqB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-521aa76a-8a33-4210-8e27-be99ece9f52c.png"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_562346128868115366": {
      "type": "gp-section-562346128868115366",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "35101528b5b3d041f44bed7e005a2e2bad1a7158b892465a0b12108e2cb64d93_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gpubOZkHVclLg_text": "<p>Why Menopause Sabotages Your Metabolism (And How to Fix It)&nbsp;</p>",
        "gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text": "<p>The #1 complaint from menopausal women isn't hot flashes—it's sudden, unexplainable weight gain.</p>",
        "gjutyetiERQwe_text": "<p>So why does your body suddenly \"betray\" you when menopause begins?</p>",
        "ggsFTmw7vzK_text": "<p>The answer is the GLP-1 disruption in your gut.</p>",
        "gQzmPPxstfQnQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gGWMuYzewycKR_text": "<p>When estrogen declines during menopause, two critical changes occur:</p>",
        "gBRefzwPsvJwl_text": "<p>1. Our gut microbiome—the source of natural GLP-1 production—becomes imbalanced</p>",
        "ggwl6uLKQia_text": "<p>2. This GLP-1 deficiency triggers a hormonal chain reaction that manifests as:</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_0": "<p>Stubborn <strong>belly fat</strong> that won't budge—GLP-1 is essential for proper fat metabolism</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_1": "<p>Embarrassing <strong>bloating</strong> that adds inches to your waistline overnight</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Brain fog</strong> that makes you feel like you're walking through molasses</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_3": "<p>Overwhelming <strong>fatigue</strong> that coffee can't fix</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_4": "<p>Intense <strong>food cravings</strong> that feel impossible to resist without GLP-1&#039;s appetite control</p>",
        "gg6oVysJJxT_text": "<p>Restoring healthy GLP-1 levels by rebalancing your gut microbiome &nbsp;is the key that most menopause solutions miss completely.</p>",
        "ggHpOe1M_b5_text": "<p><strong>Your body isn't broken—it just needs targeted support to rebuild its natural GLP-1 production pathway.</strong></p>"
      }
    },
